# System information\n\nTested on Windows 11, Quest v78 (Android)\n\n### Issue description\n\nA queue_free() of GraphNode (GraphNode) throws error:\n`E 0:00:03:416   _disconnect: Attempt to disconnect a nonexistent connection from 'GraphNode:<GraphNode#29880223220>'. Signal: 'item_rect_changed', callable: 'CanvasItem::queue_redraw'.\n  <C++ Error>   Condition \"!s->slot_map.has(*p_callable.get_base_comparator())\" is true. Returning: false\n  <C++ Source>  core/object/object.cpp:1529 @ _disconnect()\n`\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nCreate a GraphEdit node\nAdd a child GraphNode\n\nConnect signal GraphEdit.delete_nodes_request to a method which finds the node, and queue_free()s it.\n\nOr, download the MRP, hit play. Select the node. Delete it.\nAppears to mirror @Naros experiences on #94810. Regression?\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[graph_node_delete_mrp.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/21090648/graph_node_delete_mrp.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Geometror","id":50084500,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwMDg0NTAw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/50084500?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror","html_url":"https://github.com/Geometror","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108